# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

Blueprint resource for defining high-level architecture patterns. Blueprints are metadata-only (no files generated) and document architecture decisions.

## Example Usage

```hcl
resource "tofukit_blueprint" "microservices" {
  name    = "microservices-architecture"
  version = "1.0.0"
  description = <<-EOT
    Microservices architecture pattern with:
    - Independent service deployments
    - API gateway for routing
    - Event-driven communication
  EOT
}
```

{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Blueprint Types

- Application Architecture (microservices, monolith, serverless)
- Technology Stacks (MEAN, LAMP, JAMstack)
- Integration Patterns (REST, GraphQL, message queues)
- Deployment Patterns (container-based, serverless, VM)
